  "description": "Instagram login and authentication for ASP.NET Core and OpenIddict. Add passwordless login with Instagram to your website or app over standard OpenID Connect (OIDC): users scan a QR code on the sign-in page (on a phone, they tap a button) and confirm in Instagram Direct — no password, no SMS code. Your users can sign in this way on a computer, a TV, a kiosk or any other device that can show a QR code. Veriqa channel adapter (satellite package).",
